    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Base class for an object whose job is to assemble equations on an element, that is, to increment the local matrix and right-hand side vector.</para>
<para>This design is borrowed from the chaos-polymtl/lethe project. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
